{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "0b71d01b-4031-47d4-b93d-b842573d8004",
    "name": "Parking · vehicle-service",
    "description": "vehicle-service — verificado contra `origin/release123` el 2026-07-23.\n\nTodos los endpoints de esta coleccion **estan implementados y responden de\nverdad**. Base path `/v1/vehicles` (`VehicleRestAdapter`).\n\nTipos validos de `type`: `CAR`, `CAR_PMR`, `MOTORBIKE` (enum `VehicleType`).\n\nAvisos sobre el contrato:\n- `POST` y `PUT` comparten `VehicleRequest`, que exige `type`, `plate` y\n  **`active`** (`@NotNull`). Omitir `active` devuelve 400.\n- `PATCH /{id}/status` **no lee body**: siempre desactiva y devuelve 204.\n  El `active` del body que promete el openapi.yml todavia no se lee.\n- El listado **no** admite paginacion (`page`/`size`/`active`/`type`) aunque el\n  contrato la declare.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Listar vehiculos",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "vehicles"
          ]
        },
        "description": "GET /v1/vehicles -> 200 con la lista completa.\n\nSin paginacion: los parametros page/size/active/type del openapi.yml todavia no existen en el controlador."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('devuelve un array', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Crear vehiculo",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "vehicles"
          ]
        },
        "description": "POST /v1/vehicles -> 201 Created.\n\n`type`, `plate` y `active` son OBLIGATORIOS (validacion @NotBlank/@NotNull); si falta alguno -> 400.\nEl resto (`brand`, `model`, `color`, `numDoors`, `hasSidecar`) es opcional.\n\nGuarda `uniqueId` en la variable de entorno `vehicleId` y la matricula en `plate`.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\",\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"brand\": \"Seat\",\n  \"model\": \"Leon\",\n  \"color\": \"Gris\",\n  \"numDoors\": 5,\n  \"hasSidecar\": false,\n  \"active\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Matricula aleatoria (formato ES: 4 digitos + 3 letras) para poder",
              "// reejecutar la coleccion sin chocar con un vehiculo ya creado.",
              "const digits = String(Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000));",
              "const abc = 'BCDFGHJKLMNPRSTVWXYZ';",
              "let letters = '';",
              "for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {",
              "  letters += abc.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * abc.length));",
              "}",
              "pm.environment.set('plate', digits + letters);"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('devuelve uniqueId', () => pm.expect(body.uniqueId).to.be.a('string'));",
              "pm.environment.set('vehicleId', body.uniqueId);",
              "pm.environment.set('plate', body.plate);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Obtener vehiculo por id",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "vehicles",
            "{{vehicleId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "GET /v1/vehicles/{id} -> 200, o 404 si no existe (`VehicleNotFoundException`).\n\nUsa `vehicleId` de 'Crear vehiculo'."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('el id coincide', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().uniqueId).to.eql(pm.environment.get('vehicleId')));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Obtener vehiculo por matricula",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles/plate/{{plate}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "vehicles",
            "plate",
            "{{plate}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "GET /v1/vehicles/plate/{plate} -> 200, o 404 si no existe.\n\n**Este es el endpoint que consume stay-service en el check-in** (`StayVehicleClientAdapter.getOrCreateVehicle`): si da 404, stay crea el vehiculo con un POST."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('la matricula coincide', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().plate).to.eql(pm.environment.get('plate')));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Actualizar vehiculo",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "vehicles",
            "{{vehicleId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "PUT /v1/vehicles/{id} -> 200. Mismo body que el POST: `type`, `plate` y `active` obligatorios.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\",\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"brand\": \"Seat\",\n  \"model\": \"Leon FR\",\n  \"color\": \"Negro\",\n  \"numDoors\": 5,\n  \"hasSidecar\": false,\n  \"active\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('modelo actualizado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().model).to.eql('Leon FR'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Desactivar vehiculo (baja logica)",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/status",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "vehicles",
            "{{vehicleId}}",
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "description": "PATCH /v1/vehicles/{id}/status -> 204 No Content.\n\n**Sin body.** El controlador no lee `active`: siempre desactiva (`deleteVehicleUseCase.deactivate`). Reactivar no es posible por REST hoy.\n\nDeja el vehiculo listo para probar **RN-11** en el check-in de stay (vehiculo desactivado -> 422)."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
